<title>COLOMBIA: Colombian peso dips 1.7 pesos to 1,085.10.</title>
<headline>Colombian peso dips 1.7 pesos to 1,085.10.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombian peso fell 1.7 pesos to 1,085.10 against the dollar amid heavy demand for greenbacks from banks, interbank traders said.</p>
<p>The dollar rate dropped slowly during the morning until the banks started buying dollars around midday, a dealer said.</p>
<p>The peso opened at its intraday high of 1,083.10 against the dollar, and saw a low of 1,085.30. Dealers reported a total of 363 trades worth $175 million.</p>
<p>((-- Nelson Bocanegra, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
